\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Away in a manger, 
\par no crib for a bed,
\par The little Lord Jesus 
\par laid down His sweet head.
\par The stars in the bright sky 
\par looked down where He lay,
\par The little Lord Jesus 
\par asleep on the hay.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. The cattle are lowing, 
\par the Baby awakes,
\par But little Lord Jesus 
\par no crying He makes,
\par I love Thee, Lord Jesus! 
\par Look down from the sky,
\par And stay by my side 
\par until morning is nigh.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Be near me, Lord Jesus; 
\par I ask Thee to stay
\par Close by me for ever, 
\par and love me, I pray.
\par Bless all the dear children 
\par in Thy tender care,
\par And fit us for heaven, 
\par to live with Thee there.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

